=== plain-80: width 80, height 24, profile notty, dark, glyphs ascii, plain
# logs screen-read-pager ---------------------------------------$
$
# Note$
# Mock: the Logs screen. web-01.example.net runs Debian 13, less$
# installed. Treatment read-pager, P-18 as written: the main$
# menu's 10 runs the pager at once, and returns there. A golden$
# cannot run it: this says what would run.$
$
# Note$
# The gallery runs no pager. hardn would run LESSSECURE=1 less$
# /var/log/hardn.log, then draw the main menu again.$
$
$

